{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hexplorando</strong> is a <strong>cozy 3D sandbox game</strong> that lets you <strong>discover and reinvent the real world</strong>, one hexagon at a time<strong>.</strong> As you place tiles of geography, natural resources, human settlements, and historical landmarks, you unveil the rich landscape of our planet: a relaxing experience that lets you create your ideal world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736590/extras/1ed6eb9ec70fa1dd5eeb7719d30d747a.avif?t=1770902764\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hexplorando represents the world with hexagonal tiles. A tile is composed of 6 slices, each with a specific terrain (sea, plain, hill, mountain\u2026), prop (village, city, forest, crops, etc\u2026) and water properties (river and lake): a powerful system that allows the creation of a large variety of beautiful landscapes, adapting automatically each tile to its neighbours in order to always have a smooth connection or transition between the two.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736590/extras/25c71d22f918ec309160e5f43cd841ec.avif?t=1770902764\" width=616 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special tiles are used to represent landmarks with custom-made 3D models that fit perfectly with the hexagonal tile system. Landmarks include the most iconic monuments in the world (Eiffel Tower, Colosseum, Statue of Liberty, The Great Pyramid of Giza, Taj Mahal, Parthenon, Machu Picchu, Sagrada Fam\u00edlia, etc\u2026) as well as hidden gems, less renown but still wonderful natural or historical sites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736590/extras/01caef7b22514097b9a850db9011b254.avif?t=1770902764\" width=616 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sandbox Mode offers you the real Hexplorando experience,<strong> </strong>a <strong>free and relaxing gameplay </strong>that lets you <strong>create your ideal world. Procedural quests </strong>will support you in building amazing and unique landscapes using all the tiles you have previously unlocked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736590/extras/49d64022e490bc4ccf481d4462bbc07f.poster.avif?t=1770902764\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736590/extras/49d64022e490bc4ccf481d4462bbc07f.webm?t=1770902764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736590/extras/49d64022e490bc4ccf481d4462bbc07f.mp4?t=1770902764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>  </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The better you organize your creations, the more beautiful they are, the higher you score! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736590/extras/ecc751b8cfb2881cb5054bca91a6607d.avif?t=1770902764\" width=616 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each puzzle, you start with a set of tiles you can choose from. You can move and rotate them as you like, but a tile can only be placed where their borders match with the surrounding tiles, so<strong> if you don\u2019t carefully plan your movements, you can put yourself against a corner.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736590/extras/9713cae53d44c80f98d5933fa6865d8c.poster.avif?t=1770902764\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736590/extras/9713cae53d44c80f98d5933fa6865d8c.webm?t=1770902764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736590/extras/9713cae53d44c80f98d5933fa6865d8c.mp4?t=1770902764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you find the right way to fit all the tiles, you will <strong>learn more about the landmarks</strong> you\u2019re finding on the way, and <strong>unlock the neighboring puzzles</strong> to continue your \u201chexploration\u201d. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ACKNOWLEDGMENTS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hexplorando was part of V\u00f2rtex preincubation program...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >... and it's currently accelerated by El Jap!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736590/extras/285ad9415c22eb259d40ab7944fa3075.avif?t=1770902764\" width=620 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A very special thanks to Video Games Without Borders community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736590/extras/cc03cd84267085e8e3b8fb06bc61393d.avif?t=1770902764\" width=620 height=208 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2736590?t=1770902764","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2736590?t=1770902764","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736590/429e47953db6a0b8284662b3295dd9d3f7c11237/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770902764","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736590/429e47953db6a0b8284662b3295dd9d3f7c11237/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770902764","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hexplorando</strong> is a <strong>cozy 3D sandbox game</strong> that lets you <strong>discover and reinvent the real world</strong>, one hexagon at a time<strong>.</strong> As you place tiles of geography, natural resources, human settlements, and historical landmarks, you unveil the rich landscape of our planet: a relaxing experience that lets you create your ideal world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736590/extras/1ed6eb9ec70fa1dd5eeb7719d30d747a.avif?t=1770902764\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hexplorando represents the world with hexagonal tiles. A tile is composed of 6 slices, each with a specific terrain (sea, plain, hill, mountain\u2026), prop (village, city, forest, crops, etc\u2026) and water properties (river and lake): a powerful system that allows the creation of a large variety of beautiful landscapes, adapting automatically each tile to its neighbours in order to always have a smooth connection or transition between the two.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736590/extras/25c71d22f918ec309160e5f43cd841ec.avif?t=1770902764\" width=616 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special tiles are used to represent landmarks with custom-made 3D models that fit perfectly with the hexagonal tile system. Landmarks include the most iconic monuments in the world (Eiffel Tower, Colosseum, Statue of Liberty, The Great Pyramid of Giza, Taj Mahal, Parthenon, Machu Picchu, Sagrada Fam\u00edlia, etc\u2026) as well as hidden gems, less renown but still wonderful natural or historical sites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736590/extras/01caef7b22514097b9a850db9011b254.avif?t=1770902764\" width=616 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sandbox Mode offers you the real Hexplorando experience,<strong> </strong>a <strong>free and relaxing gameplay </strong>that lets you <strong>create your ideal world. Procedural quests </strong>will support you in building amazing and unique landscapes using all the tiles you have previously unlocked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736590/extras/49d64022e490bc4ccf481d4462bbc07f.poster.avif?t=1770902764\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736590/extras/49d64022e490bc4ccf481d4462bbc07f.webm?t=1770902764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736590/extras/49d64022e490bc4ccf481d4462bbc07f.mp4?t=1770902764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>  </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The better you organize your creations, the more beautiful they are, the higher you score! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736590/extras/ecc751b8cfb2881cb5054bca91a6607d.avif?t=1770902764\" width=616 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each puzzle, you start with a set of tiles you can choose from. You can move and rotate them as you like, but a tile can only be placed where their borders match with the surrounding tiles, so<strong> if you don\u2019t carefully plan your movements, you can put yourself against a corner.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736590/extras/9713cae53d44c80f98d5933fa6865d8c.poster.avif?t=1770902764\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736590/extras/9713cae53d44c80f98d5933fa6865d8c.webm?t=1770902764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736590/extras/9713cae53d44c80f98d5933fa6865d8c.mp4?t=1770902764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you find the right way to fit all the tiles, you will <strong>learn more about the landmarks</strong> you\u2019re finding on the way, and <strong>unlock the neighboring puzzles</strong> to continue your \u201chexploration\u201d. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ACKNOWLEDGMENTS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hexplorando was part of V\u00f2rtex preincubation program...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >... and it's currently accelerated by El Jap!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736590/extras/285ad9415c22eb259d40ab7944fa3075.avif?t=1770902764\" width=620 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A very special thanks to Video Games Without Borders community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736590/extras/cc03cd84267085e8e3b8fb06bc61393d.avif?t=1770902764\" width=620 height=208 /></span></p>","developers":["Francesco Cavallari"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736590/header.jpg?t=1770902764","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2736590/436597918/8326e1b45dba714000b4892069d660f7cccbee17/1762419234/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762433604","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2736590/436597918/8326e1b45dba714000b4892069d660f7cccbee17/1762419234/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762433604","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2736590/436597918/8326e1b45dba714000b4892069d660f7cccbee17/1762419234/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762433604","id":257227517,"name":"Gameplay - Puzzle Mode","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257227517/435203cb212a0ce2f8ddc89d61823c674e7af770/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1762433604"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2736590/1646066120/26fa0d4a2c80b316e05821bf8aebc220d11f8501/1762429255/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762433603","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2736590/1646066120/26fa0d4a2c80b316e05821bf8aebc220d11f8501/176242